1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,219
The evidence on the table concerned a point of law and a pile of old bills.

2
00:00:04,219 --> 00:00:10,533
“The previous administration left a wholly irregular account,” the auditor said.

3
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:22,951
“There is no factual basis for the figure, and the province has been lodging the cost in the wrong column.” Nobody was afraid to say it aloud this time.

4
00:00:22,951 --> 00:00:29,520
The incident that made the case was a robbery of the meter box and a riot at the water office.

5
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:35,054
“A scandal of this size is not occasional,” an economist said.

6
00:00:35,054 --> 00:00:49,637
“It is inevitable while the system dissolves into a hundred small payments.” A jealous official had disturbed the record, and the golden seal on the monument outside had been stolen twice.

7
00:00:49,637 --> 00:00:57,806
The stable next to the yard, the foggy morning, and the haze over the river all pointed to the same corner.

8
00:00:57,806 --> 00:01:03,525
“We cannot climb out of this with encouragement and amusement,” she said.

9
00:01:03,525 --> 00:01:10,495
“The cornerstone of the argument is a single account, kept in its entirety.”

10
00:01:10,495 --> 00:01:17,313
The weather of the meeting turned when a shopkeeper spoke about a continual stream of small payments.

11
00:01:17,313 --> 00:01:22,518
“My jealousy of the big firms is not the point,” he said.

12
00:01:22,518 --> 00:01:28,732
“The point is that the meter melts my margin and the guarantee boils away.”

13
00:01:28,732 --> 00:01:33,557
The committee asked for a convenient summary of a monstrous file.

14
00:01:33,557 --> 00:01:40,216
“A stable budget and a solemnity of procedure are not the same thing,” the mayor said.

15
00:01:40,216 --> 00:01:45,920
“Legislate quickly and the impossibility becomes a grievance.”

16
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:57,758
The evidence was complete enough to name the misfortune: a system with no single owner, a spoil of small favours, and a shade of doubt over every receipt.

17
00:01:57,758 --> 00:02:02,127
“The total is not the story,” the auditor said.

18
00:02:02,127 --> 00:02:16,656
“The story is who signed the lodging bills.” The benefit of the congress was a data set and a computer program that could name every county claim; the cell of auditors had nothing but a machine and a story.

19
00:02:16,656 --> 00:02:20,605
“This is not science,” the auditor said.

20
00:02:20,605 --> 00:02:38,513
“It is a system with a source and an operation, and it grieves me that it works.” A grand disorder, a shady ledger, and a stability bought with a grievous loan: the whole fulfilment of the account turned out to be instantaneous and false.

21
00:02:38,513 --> 00:02:46,361
Free energy was not a technology the council owned, and the county knew that too.
